# Iridescent Angel, "protection from each color" (CR 702.16a): protection from all five colors at once, and not from colorless
# (CR 105.2c). Bot2, with the mana for each, cannot target it with a red Lightning Bolt (turn 2), a blue Unsummon (turn 2), nor
# enchant it with a green Rancor (turn 2); a colorless Pyrite Spellbomb's ability can target it and marks 2 damage (turn 4, the
# control for targeting). On Bot1's turn 3 the Angel attacks past Bot2's flying Birds of Paradise (green), which may not block
# it, and the colorless Ornithopter, which does (the control for blocking). A red Pyroclasm on turn 6 deals the Angel no damage
# (it kills Bot2's own creatures), while Bot1's colorless Basilisk Collar may be equipped to it (the control for enchanting).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Iridescent Angel
Basilisk Collar
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Lightning Bolt
Unsummon
Birds of Paradise
Ornithopter
Rancor
Pyrite Spellbomb
Pyroclasm
Island x14

